ss" /><summary type="html">The Australian interior minister said reducing migration is needed to address housing pressures. The move comes amid a far-right surge in the polls.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Mysterious explosions reported in Frankfurt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:43511e47780588e034e6785b2d515678393b57aa2be13da8aaaf1acc0f337938</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:37:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T08:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-mysterious-explosions-reported-in-frankfurt/live-79300494--1397711c1e30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-mysterious-explosions-reported-in-frankfurt/live-79300494?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A cafe and kiosk were damaged overnight in Frankfurt, in what police said are the latest in a series of mysterious blasts in the area. Meanwhile, diesel prices in Germany have hit an all-time high. More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: New Delhi denies claims world leaders fell ill after BRICS summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:83239cbd052c5e3aaf95166c56392b1fa380bb64408454d7374bf470838269fa</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:37:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T08:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-denies-claims-world-leaders-fell-ill-after-brics-summit/live-79300604--d5a9663f9e7d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-denies-claims-world-leaders-fell-ill-after-brics-summit/live-79300604?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">India's foreign ministry rejected viral social media claims that leaders fell ill after the BRICS summit. Meanwhile, India defended its right to buy oil from diverse sources after the US passed a new sanctions bill.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saint, sinner or femi