da.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/openai-discloses-new-concerning-behavior/a-79300180?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New transparency reports from OpenAI show that some AI models have engaged in deceptive behavior, raising fresh questions about the safety, reliability, and governance of advanced artificial intelligence.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Russian strikes injure several in Kyiv, Odesa</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7df09d4162c5d0eb4a101a217c1cda896854c1e8332b70869da69dde63a7c189</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:36:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T02:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-russian-strikes-injure-several-in-kyiv-odesa/a-79299579--20bf3baf8de7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-russian-strikes-injure-several-in-kyiv-odesa/a-79299579?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russian airstrikes hit apartment buildings and warehouses in Ukraine, injuring several people, including a child.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump threatens EU with further sanctions over Canada</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0fbdef7fa321cfddf462f42f79bb8134be0e00b659d29bad0d7488ffcb076f12</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:36:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T01:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-threatens-eu-with-further-sanctions-over-canada/a-79299548--f29a1bf1cfac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-threatens-eu-with-further-sanctions-over-canada/a-79299548?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU had signaled that Canada is poised to become the bloc's first associate member. Trump called the idea both "laughable" and a "hostile act."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How climate change worsened Nepal's deadly mountain collapse</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f3f21991b0fe6af8e9b9d6f034eb2c1dec08a3607ec5c5749269f4a5c124f489</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:36:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T23:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-climate-change-worsened-nepal-s-deadly-mountain-collapse/a-79293578--691d9083ccec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-climate-change-worsened-nepal-s-deadly-mountain-collapse/a-79293578?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A glacier and rock collapse in Nepal killed nearly 1,400 people and left thousands missing. Scientists say decades of warming helped set the disaster in motion.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>US Congress passes Russia sanctions bill</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d3aae54bb1a942a1d896161982ece34ab8b55fe322957c7dd044563204a8182c</id><updated>2026-09-17T13:36:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T23:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-congress-passes-russia-sanctions-bill/a-79299088--c37fcf134869.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-congress-passes-russia-sanctions-bill/a-79299088?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The sanctions package is considered the most substantial US legislative effort against Moscow since Trump returned to the White House. Measures in the bill could lead to secondary sanctions on India, China and Iran.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
